{"title":"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 33","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_33&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the coefficient of the third term in the binomial expansion of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/d/17d2a1476f0127e26bcf258a85c71d07a2f2773f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1 - 3x)^{1/4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"88\" height=\"23\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/6/486fb349eda76b48b6a0bfe0dda9f86d90ef54a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-a/b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are relatively prime integers, find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add2609af1bb7632cc22b68fd49fdd94de06b327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_33&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the general binomial theorem, the coefficient of the third term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/5/e257dfcc4f59857eb732775d12b02141ed82dcb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dbinom{1/4}{2}\\cdot(-3)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"115\" height=\"55\" />. Computing the general binomial coefficient, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/f/dafe5fdf96db59a0259a612576e892c1fb822455.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dbinom{1/4}{2}=\\dfrac{\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot(\\frac{1}{4}-1)}{2}=\\dfrac{-3}{32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"217\" height=\"55\" />. Multiplying by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/8/588f74fc6fe4a7b467433ddc2ce70c7f805b82e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-3)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"47\" height=\"21\" /> gives us a coefficient of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/5/b6503037585080dada43b7592bb140fe40dc3013.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{-27}{32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/4/d044ea2cd669ea89a05b617fc7db819d5bf87e2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=27, b=32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"112\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/d/e2d7f712f6108129f0165215d4b9cfb9a8501621.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b=\\boxed{59}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"95\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_33&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest\" title=\"2005 iTest\">2005 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems